        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Weekly hackathon pipeline: poll → topic → PRD → slides → review → deliver&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;one Node.js process · one SQLite file · 4 LLM agents · web RSVP UI" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
